ttps://arxiv.org/abs/1609.03053).[Bibcode](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bibcode_(identifier)):[2017JPlPh..83d9001K](https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/2017JPlPh..83d9001K).[doi](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doi_(identifier)):[10.1017/S002237781700040X](https://doi.org/10.1017%2FS002237781700040X).[S2CID](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/S2CID_(identifier))[8207132](https://api.semanticscholar.org/CorpusID:8207132).\n- [↑](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Symplectic_integrator#cite_ref-17)Xiao, J.; Qin, H.; Liu, J. (2018). \"Structure-preserving geometric particle-in-cell methods for Vlasov-Maxwell systems\".*Plasma Science and Technology*.**20**(11): 110501.[arXiv](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ArXiv_(identifier)):[1804.08823](https://arxiv.org/abs/1804.08823).[Bibcode](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bibcode_(identifier)):[2018PlST...20k0501X](https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/2018PlST...20k0501X).[doi](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doi_(identifier)):[10.1088/2058-6272/aac3d1](https://doi.org/10.1088%2F2058-6272%2Faac3d1).[S2CID](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/S2CID_(identifier))[250801157](https://api.semanticscholar.org/CorpusID:250801157).\n- [↑](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Symplectic_integrator#cite_ref-18)Glasser, A.; Qin, H. (2022). \"A gauge-compatible Hamiltonian splitting algorithm for particle-in-cell simulations using finite element exterior calculus\".*Journal of Plasma Physics*.**88**(2): 835880202.[arXiv](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ArXiv_(identifier)):[2110.10346](https://arxiv.org/abs/2110.10346).[Bibcode](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bibcode_(identifier)):[2022JPlPh..88b8302G](https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/2022JPlPh..88b8302G).[doi](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doi_(identifier)):[10.1017/S0022377822000290](https://doi.org/10.1017%2FS0022377822000290).[S2CID](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/S2CID_(identifier))[239049433](https://api.semanticscholar.org/CorpusID:239049433).\n\n- Leimkuhler, Ben; Reich, Sebastian (2005).*Simulating Hamiltonian Dynamic